abstract: >-
  Exact symbolic calculations, certified root brackets, an independent
  first-principles verifier of the article's claims, the Richardson-extrapolation
  corollary of the signed first-defect law, candidate-map tests, pointwise
  transverse-field certificates, certified adaptive-guard telemetry, deterministic
  figures and tables with accessibility audits, and regression tests supporting
  finite-step complete-positivity classifications of Runge-Kutta discretizations
  of phase-covariant qubit Lindblad dynamics.
